“What do I need to know and do today?”

Every dashboard should therefore have:

* Summary Cards
* Action Buttons
* Notifications
* Pending Tasks
* Charts
* Recent Activities
* Quick Links
* Calendar
* Announcements
* AI Insights (where applicable)

